      <td class="p-2">Ad: "Unlock Predictable $10k+ Sales Months"<br/>Content: "The Ecom Owner's Path to Scalable Growth & Peace of Mind"<br/>Social: "Imagine effortlessly creating high-converting emails..."</td>
