      <td class="p-2">Ad: "Myth: You Need Complex Funnels for Ecom AI Success"<br/>Social: "Why most ChatGPT prompts fail for Ecom (& the one that works)..."<br/>Video: "Stop doing *this* with your Ecom AI..."</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
